 且 F1 无损，CF violation 上升为已知 limitation\\\\n  rationale: v2 干净数据全量（551/551）结果经 Reviewer PASS 验证：Full S1 DR 15.37%→0.93%（↓94%），R-F1\\\\n    +0.13pp，ET/RV→0%。Ablation story 清晰（grammar 管格式、semantic 管语义、双层协同）。CF violation\\\\n    从 0.08%→9.9% 是已知副作用，需在论文中正面报告并论述与 DR 的性质差异。Semantic-only DR=11.65% 说明两层是 multiplicative\\\\n    关系。决定推进 DocRED Phase 2 跨数据集验证 + 等 S2 对比。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.37%, R-F1=0.0823\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_grammar_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=14.84%, RV/ET=0%, F1持平\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=11.65%, F1-0.08pp\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: core_result\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, R-F1=0.0836(+0.13pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_docred_schema\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: DocRED DR=12.8%(-32%), 验证prompt级不足\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: S2 降级为架构 ablation，S1 为主推策略；标题去掉 \\\\\\\"Guaranteed\\\\\\\" 改 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: S2 全量结果(551/551)确认：DR 0.97%(vs S1 0.93%)、CF 8.03%(vs S1 9.9%，降幅不显著)、R-F1\\\\n    8.03%(vs S1 8.36%)。S2 在所有指标上均未优于 S1，两通道分离未能解决 CF 问题。CF 是 per-relation 独立 type\\\\n    enforcement 的固有限制，非架构可解。S2 定位从\\\\\\\"CF 解决方案\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"架构灵活性展示\\\\\\\"，论文中放 ablation/appendix。标题\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Guaranteed\\\\\\\" 与 0.93% 残余不符，改为 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR=0.97%, CF=8.03%, R-F1=8.03% — no advantage over S1\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, CF=9.9%, R-F1=8.36%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 补跑 DocRED semantic_only 完成跨数据集全消融；论文写作提前至 DocRED 分析完成后立即启动\\\\n  rationale: 'SciERC 有 5 路消融但 DocRED 只有 grammar_only + full_s1，缺 semantic_only。Claim\\\\n    3 (enabling dependency) 在 DocRED 上的证据链不完整——审稿人必问\\\\\\\"为何 DocRED 不做 semantic_only 对比\\\\\\\"。DocRED\\\\n    约束更紧(avg 5.68 valid pairs)，semantic_only 预期效果更差，反而是 enabling dependency 的更强证据。论文写作从\\\\n    5/19 提前到 DocRED 分析完成后(~5/16)，DocRED semantic_only 与写作并行，结果 patch 进去。grammar-semantic\\\\n    交互 bug (invariant: semantic mask ⊆ grammar allowed set) 需写入 Method section 作为\\\\n    resolution protocol。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_grammar_only\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: DR↓24% but ET/RV not eliminated\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: Llama-3.1-8B cross-model 验证升级为 should-have，SciERC-only (unconstrained +\\\\n    full_s1)\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 实测 DocRED 实验进度远超预期（May 15 早间全部完成 vs 原估 May 17-18），多出 2-3 天 buffer。单模型是最可能的\\\\n    EMNLP reviewer 批评 (C5)，2 组 SciERC 实验 4-6 GPU 小时即可完成，风险可控。constraint compiler 声称\\\\n    model-agnostic，跨模型验证是最直接的证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline_same_model\\\\n    result: DR↓94% F1无损\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline_same_model\\\\n    result: DR 15.37%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 三档 Weak Reject (3/6) → 制定 6 项结构性补强计划：post-hoc baseline + bootstrap\\\\n    CI + related work 20+ + PICARD 对比 + CF/F1 Discussion 段\\\\n  rationale: Dream 模拟三档一致指出 6 个结构性缺陷：(1) 单模型泛化弱 → Llama cross-model 已在跑，(2) 无 post-hoc\\\\n    filtering baseline → 必须加，(3) related work 仅 7 引用 → 扩到 20+，(4) 无统计显著性 → bootstrap\\\\n    CI，(5) CF trade-off 无下游验证 → 加强论证，(6) 低 F1 实用性 → Discussion 段。Dream 基于缺少 Llama\\\\n    数据 + 有 bug 的 violation 数字，实际情况好于模拟。补强后预期从 3/6 提升到 4-5/6 区间。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: addresses U1 (cross-model)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: addresses U1 (cross-model)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: addresses U1 (cross-model)\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 推翻之前 ET 计数口径决定——修正 ET triple-counting，每个 entity 只计 1 次 ET violation（不在\\\\n    entity_list + head + tail 各计一次）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查指出：(1) ET=8.18% 被 inflate 至多 3× (实际 ~2.47%)，是不必要的攻击面；(2) grammar/full_s1\\\\n    ET=0% 不受影响；(3) 相对对比仍有效；(4) 距 May 19 DDL 仍有修正窗口。之前\\\\\\\"保持一致性\\\\\\\"的理由成立但 Reviewer 认为论文可信度\\\\n    > 方法学惰性。修正后所有非零 ET 数字将变小，但 constrained decoding 的 ET→0% 仍然成立，paper story 更干净。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: ET 8.18%→~2.47%\\\\n    result: 需重算\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ET 10.44%→~3.5%\\\\n    result: 需重算\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Bootstrap CI framing: 选 (B) 逐数据集报告 F1 significance，DocRED +0.50pp p<0.001，SciERC\\\\n    neutral p=0.58'\\\\n  rationale: Bootstrap CI (10000×) 揭示 DocRED F1 提升统计显著，机制为 grammar 消除 OOV relation\\\\n    names (RV 29.66%→0.03%) 减少 FP。SciERC RV 仅 1.39% 故效果不显著。选逐数据集报告而非统一 framing，最诚实且不升级为\\\\n    core claim。更新 paper_framing.md 中 C6/C8 相关表述。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 +0.50pp vs unconstrained, p<0.001\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 +0.13pp vs unconstrained, p=0.58 (non-significant)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Post-hoc baseline framing: 不以 F1 论高低，多维对比 (recall + coverage + operational)，诚实承认\\\\n    precision trade-off'\\\\n  rationale: Post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1（SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.24），因\\\\n    low F1 regime 下移除 FP 大幅提升 precision。但 post-hoc recall 下降（SciERC -0.72pp, DocRED\\\\n    -1.06pp），DocRED 丢弃 48.1% triples。OntoCoDec recall 上升（+0.20/+0.56pp）= 概率质量重分配生效。Framing\\\\n    重心放在 recall preservation + information coverage + streaming compatibility，诚实承认\\\\n    precision trade-off。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R-F1 8.23\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 8.36, recall 11.60\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R-F1 7.74\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: R-F1 8.24, recall 10.02\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: Tightness scaling claim 修订：从单因素(tightness)改为双因素(tightness × model RV baseline)。Llama\\\\n    DocRED DR↓90.2% 打破原 \\\\\\\"scales inversely with tightness\\\\\\\" claim。\\\\n  rationale: Llama DocRED full_s1 DR 26.07%→2.55% (↓90.2%) vs Qwen 18.46%→10.21% (↓44.7%)。同一\\\\n    ontology (τ̄=0.842) 下差距巨大。原因：Qwen RV=29.66% 远高于 Llama RV=16.03%，grammar 层将 OOV\\\\n    triples 强制匹配有效关系名后揭露大量 latent DR violations。修订为\\\\\\\"tightness 与 model RV baseline\\\\n    共同决定 enforcement ceiling\\\\\\\"。这实际强化论文——揭示 model-constraint 交互效应。同时 E-F1 claim 需限定为\\\\n    Qwen-specific（Llama E-F1 -0.64pp）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR 26.07→2.55 (↓90.2%), R-F1 +0.29pp, E-F1 -0.64pp, CF 12.02%\\\\n  - exp_id: llama_docred_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR 26.07%, RV 16.03%, R-F1 5.98%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: DR 10.21% (↓44.7%), Qwen RV baseline 29.66%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D013\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 10303, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012cpiPbcALRrGoQNXCn6Urx","session_id":"c22f8857-e04e-4f5b-a2f0-8fc78112cf68","uuid":"635133ff-ef3e-48f2-b2d9-2eb412d3c5a0","timestamp":"2026-05-14T21:36:09.776Z"}
